SUMMARY:Griefshare - Loss of Spouse
DESCRIPTION:Loss of a Spouse GriefShare is for women and men who have lost their spouses. While all loss is significant\, a spouse’s loss can come with its own unique hardship and pain. If you are still reeling from your spouse’s departure from life\, this group is for you.\nLoss of a Spouse meets for 13 weeks in the fall and spring on Wednesday afternoons from 3:00-4:30pm.\nRegister\nhttps://www.griefshare.org/groups/264485
URL:https://www.calvarychurch.org/calendar/griefshare-loss-of-spouse-27/
CATEGORIES:Pastoral Care
END:VEVENT
